title: TigerDialogue
---
This is an example of a Yarn Spinner script. Write your dialogue here!
===
title: LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase="">>
<<declare $hasVisited = false>>
<<SetPhase Npc>>
//the npc gameobject.name called in the set phase command should map to the specific npc you want to reference
//for instance if you have particualr gameobject npc you want this to call from make sure you use that gameobject name
<<if $dialoguePhase == "begin">>
<<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "comeback">>
<<jump comeback>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questStarted">>
<<jump questStarted>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "questCompleted">>
<<jump questCompleted>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase == "rewardGiven">>
<<jump rewardGiven>>
<<else>>
Tiger: dude you suck, fix ur code.
<<endif>>

===